  "details": "Please add a pixel-art shader to improve the visual fidelity of nearest-neighbor filtered textures, especially on Quest avatars.\nCurrently, we have the following workarounds:\n- Upscale the texture and use bilinear filter (affects VRAM adversely)\n- Use nearest neighbor filtering (causes flickering / aliasing)\n- Use a third party pixel art shader (somewhat inaccessible, esp on Quest)",
